## 💡 Why This Project?
This project demonstrates modern frontend engineering principles by combining utility-first CSS tooling (`Tailwind v4`) with vanilla JavaScript state persistence (`localStorage`). It proves that sleek, professional, production-ready e-commerce user experiences can be architected with lightweight, zero-framework web technologies.

